Native FreeBSD kernel driver for Broadcom FullMAC Wi-Fi devices. This build
includes the BCM4364 PCIe bring-up and scan bounds changes exercised on a
MacBookPro16,1 hardware preview. Device and board firmware are separate and
must be obtained through a verified acquisition path.

The aarch64 SDIO path requires a matching MMCCAM kernel, working board power
and pin configuration, and the correct firmware/NVRAM/CLM files. Installing
the module does not supply those prerequisites or establish Pi Wi-Fi acceptance.
